\\\\ Named features in Sigi

\\\\ Define a named function
{ .greet
    "Hello from .greet!\n"
}

\\\\ Call it
( .greet )

\\\\ Named variables
!123 :.my_var
.my_var |    \\\\ should print 123

\\\\ Using them together
{ .add_ten
    !10 + :.my_var
}

!50 (.add_ten)
.my_var |    \\\\ should print 60
